nt it."]],"cap":"Revisão integrada — política"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Um e-mail de convite combina **preferência**, **passiva** e **causativa** com tom educado."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"We ___ rather hold it on Friday. (would)","a":"would","why":"would rather."},{"s":"The room has been ___ . (book, part.)","a":"booked","why":"passiva."},{"s":"I will get the agenda ___ today. (send, part.)","a":"sent","why":"get + part."},{"s":"Someone ___ have sent it already. (must)","a":"must","why":"must have."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["invitation text","texto de convite"],["RSVP deadline","prazo de confirmação"],["room booking","reserva de sala"],["venue capacity","capacidade do local"],["opening statement slot","vaga de declaração inicial"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["room","been","booked","Yes","Has","the"],"ans":"Yes Has the room been booked","pt":"Sim. A sala foi reservada?"},{"words":["on","Friday","Would","you","rather","meet"],"ans":"Would you rather meet on Friday","pt":"Prefere se encontrar na sexta?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"invitation text","pos":"word","pt":"texto de convite","ex":"Invitation text.","expt":"Texto de convite."},{"w":"RSVP deadline","pos":"word","pt":"prazo de confirmação","ex":"RSVP deadline.","expt":"Prazo de confirmação."},{"w":"venue capacity","pos":"word","pt":"capacidade do local","ex":"Venue capacity.","expt":"Capacidade do local."},{"w":"opening statement slot","pos":"word","pt":"vaga de declaração inicial","ex":"Opening statement slot.","expt":"Vaga de declaração inicial."},{"w":"debate motion","pos":"word","pt":"moção do debate","ex":"Debate motion.","expt":"Moção do debate."},{"w":"speaker lineup","pos":"word","pt":"lista de oradores","ex":"Speaker lineup.","ex